{
  "name": "dsh-course-studio",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "课程工坊（零 API 密钥 · agent 原生）：基于 Mathigon 交互教科书方法论制作高质量 STEM 互动课件——agent 按 skill 在本地 Mathigon 仓库创作课程（content.md + functions.ts + styles.scss），course_studio 工具负责课程盘点 / 环境自检 / 编译校验（拦 Maths parsing error）/ 课件存证 / 预览服务管理；侧栏「课程工坊」看板：概览 / 发起制作 / 课件档案（存证可回看）/ 真实课件预览（iframe 嵌入本地 mgon-serve 渲染页）。",
  "license": "MIT",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "src/host.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./src/host.js",
    "./client": "./dist/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "icon": "./icon.svg",
  "files": [
    "src",
    "dist",
    "lib",
    "lab",
    "skills",
    "locale/*.json",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md",
    "LICENSE"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness"
  ],
  "engines": {
    "node": "^22.19.0 || >=24.0.0",
    "dsh": ">=0.2.1-rc.2 <0.3.0"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": []
    }
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/schemastery": "^3.19.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "esbuild": "^0.25.10"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node scripts/build.mjs",
    "test": "node test/lib.test.mjs",
    "prepack": "npm run build"
  }
}
